MeeGo-like look (pro1x-maemo-leste patches/meego): while the root window
has _HILDON_MEEGO_LOOK (hildon-desktop sets it), the application menu as a
list (one column), as the N9's menus; the columns of selectors with
several of them (the date and time pickers) as the N9's wheels: the
chosen row in a band, the others fading out, a column that stops rolling
chooses the row in its middle.

